      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24876/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season hens inside and out with salt and pepper to taste, then stuff with equal amounts of vegetable mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KZsCnid4hc3Q4MapyX0f5e2HpTk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24876-baked-cornish-game-hens-VAT-step-03-4259e7ec64424a46b72bac512b8e3a89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24876/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place stuffed hens in a 9x13 inch baking dish, breast-side up. Drizzle with 1/4 cup melted butter.",
